Handlers whose names export to the same TemplateRoutePaths method
collide.
-- index.gohtml --
{{define "GET /a list()"}}{{end}}
{{define "GET /b List()"}}{{end}}
-- server.go --
package server
-- want/error.txt --
TemplateRoutePaths method name collision: handlers "list" and "List" both produce method "List"
index.gohtml:1:11: "list" is defined here
index.gohtml:2:11: "List" is defined here
